    "source": "deployments/*-testnet, layerzero.testnet-config.ts, layerzero.testnet-evm-config.ts, hardhat.config.ts. Owner, delegate, decimals, sharedDecimals, token() and peers verified on-chain 2026-10-03.",
    "notes": [
      "ownerAndDelegate is the deployer EOA, not a multisig.",
      "Sepolia hub tokens were deployed 2026-09-08 from the pre-rename contracts TokenOFT6/TokenOFT9/TokenOFT18 (renamed to OFTToken6/OFTToken18 and OFTToken9Seeded on 2026-10-02). The Sepolia wSOL and jitoSOL tokens are plain TokenOFT9 and have no seed() function.",
      "Solana Devnet OFT stores were created 2026-02-12 under a separate devnet OFT program and have their own admins, listed per bridge as originAdmin / originDelegate. The jitoSOL devnet store has not been wired to Sepolia (no peer set on either side).",
      "The devnet SOL_OFT.json and JITOSOL_OFT.json deployment files are hand-maintained; the 'endpoint' value in JITOSOL_OFT.json does not match the endpoint program the store reports on-chain, which is recorded here as originLzEndpoint."
    ]
